{"q":"5","t":"Longest Palindromic Substring","d":"Medium","p":false,"c":"<p>Given a string <code>s</code>, return <em>the longest</em> <span data-keyword=\"palindromic-string\"><em>palindromic</em></span> <span data-keyword=\"substring-nonempty\"><em>substring</em></span> in <code>s</code>.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> s = &quot;babad&quot;\n<strong>Output:</strong> &quot;bab&quot;\n<strong>Explanation:</strong> &quot;aba&quot; is also a valid answer.\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> s = &quot;cbbd&quot;\n<strong>Output:</strong> &quot;bb&quot;\n</pre>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= s.length &lt;= 1000</code></li>\n\t<li><code>s</code> consist of only digits and English letters.</li>\n</ul>\n","h":["How can we reuse a previously computed palindrome to compute a larger palindrome?","If “aba” is a palindrome, is “xabax” a palindrome? Similarly is “xabay” a palindrome?","Complexity based hint:</br>\r\nIf we use brute-force and check whether for every start and end position a substring is a palindrome we have O(n^2) start - end pairs and O(n) palindromic checks. Can we reduce the time for palindromic checks to O(1) by reusing some previous computation."],"m":"{ \n  \"name\": \"longestPalindrome\",\n  \"params\": [\n    { \n      \"name\": \"s\",\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"return\": {\n    \"type\": \"string\"\n  }\n}","g":[{"name":"Two Pointers","slug":"two-pointers"},{"name":"String","slug":"string"},{"name":"Dynamic Programming","slug":"dynamic-programming"},{"name":"Manacher","slug":"manacher"}],"s":[{"t":"Shortest Palindrome","s":"shortest-palindrome","d":"Hard","p":false},{"t":"Palindrome Permutation","s":"palindrome-permutation","d":"Easy","p":false},{"t":"Palindrome Pairs","s":"palindrome-pairs","d":"Hard","p":false},{"t":"Longest Palindromic Subsequence","s":"longest-palindromic-subsequence","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Palindromic Substrings","s":"palindromic-substrings","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Maximum Number of Non-overlapping Palindrome Substrings","s":"maximum-number-of-non-overlapping-palindrome-substrings","d":"Hard","p":false}],"co":[["Amazon","amazon"],["Google","google"],["Bloomberg","bloomberg"],["Microsoft","microsoft"],["Meta","facebook"],["tcs","tcs"],["Yandex","yandex"],["Infosys","infosys"],["Uber","uber"],["Visa","visa"],["Adobe","adobe"],["Apple","apple"],["EPAM Systems","epam-systems"],["Tinkoff","tinkoff"],["Cognizant","cognizant"],["TikTok","tiktok"],["Oracle","oracle"],["IBM","ibm"],["eBay","ebay"],["Accenture","accenture"],["HSBC","hsbc"],["athenahealth","athenahealth"],["Autodesk","autodesk"],["ZS Associates","zs-associates"],["HashedIn","hashedin"],["Nvidia","nvidia"],["Cisco","cisco"],["Zoho","zoho"],["Goldman Sachs","goldman-sachs"],["Walmart Labs","walmart-labs"],["PhonePe","phonepe"],["Deloitte","deloitte"],["SAP","sap"],["Salesforce","salesforce"],["Softwire","softwire"],["LinkedIn","linkedin"],["Huawei","huawei"],["JPMorgan Chase","jpmorgan"],["Morgan Stanley","morgan-stanley"],["Grab","grab"],["Shopee","shopee"],["Commvault","commvault"],["Accolite","accolite"],["persistent systems","persistent-systems"],["Palo Alto Networks","palo-alto-networks"],["Citadel","citadel"],["Turing","turing"],["HCL","hcl"],["MAQ Software","maq-software"],["Wix","wix"]]}